    {
      "conditions": [],
      "definition": "A meaning-preserving model view: project(M, Z, R) returns (M_Z, Boundary_Z), gap or refusal. M_Z contains the material closure; Boundary_Z records excluded, external, unresolved, translated and invalidation-sensitive seams.",
      "exceptions": [],
      "grounding": [
        {
