          "quote": "`M_Z` contains the material closure of `Z`, so a projection's `gap` or\n`refusal` is that of the closure it contains or of the model it acts on:\n`gap` or `refusal(basis)` (AC-007). `Boundary_Z` records excluded,\nexternal, unresolved, translated and invalidation-sensitive seams.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/AXIOMATIC_CALCULUS.md#AXIOMATIC_CALCULUS%2F4.%20Fundamental%20laws%2FAC-011%20Projection",
