      "statement": "Retain material residuals in successors absent exact authorised evidence of disposition. Failure of any identity, basis, population, local/external partition, equality, resolution witness, residual or codomain equation refuses. Exact t declares every permitted mutation; input stays unchanged, successor is merely proposed and cannot accept/admit itself. Stops map by AC-007 cause. FOUNDATIONS consumes preserved/introduced/removed records, resolution witnesses and residuals as conservation accounting.",
